    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So basically, you work for a super-secret bureau hunting anomalies. What\u2019s an anomaly? Well, it\u2019s when:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>A vending machine spits bricks</strong> (it\u2019s having a rough day)<br>\u2705 <strong>Meat whispers stuff to you</strong> (maybe it loves you, who knows)<br>\u2705 <strong>Benches run around the park</strong> (don\u2019t even ask why)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job - press buttons, freak out, and maybe lose your mind. Or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Also here:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancing Bobrito Bandito to funk beats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crocodilo Bomber plane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic discos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots more stuff your therapist told you to avoid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why bother?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd14 Dude, if you\u2019ve ever argued with a kettle or told your fridge to shut up \u2014 this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just download the demo, press some buttons, and pretend you know what\u2019s going on.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So basically, you work for a super-secret bureau hunting anomalies. What\u2019s an anomaly? Well, it\u2019s when:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>A vending machine spits bricks</strong> (it\u2019s having a rough day)<br>\u2705 <strong>Meat whispers stuff to you</strong> (maybe it loves you, who knows)<br>\u2705 <strong>Benches run around the park</strong> (don\u2019t even ask why)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job - press buttons, freak out, and maybe lose your mind. Or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/9b0744e6b953af05b773725022b4baa3.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Also here:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dancing Bobrito Bandito to funk beats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crocodilo Bomber plane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychedelic discos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots more stuff your therapist told you to avoid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/b0ed510f679421f6d140d46b5f6df911.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why bother?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd14 Dude, if you\u2019ve ever argued with a kettle or told your fridge to shut up \u2014 this game is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.poster.avif?t=1752171487\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.webm?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/3a896b46bd7d201c6b70d187df47d69a.mp4?t=1752171487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just download the demo, press some buttons, and pretend you know what\u2019s going on.</strong></p>",
